\f4 \cf3 \strokec3 spring()
\f2 \cf0 \strokec2  sur 
\f4 \cf3 \strokec3 scale
\f2 \cf0 \strokec2  + 
\f4 \cf3 \strokec3 rotate
\f2 \cf0 \strokec2  combin\'e9s.\
\ls33\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Zoom final : anime 
